OL,5,G1900 The Great Devon & Cornwall Floods
OL,6,     FIn 1952 a flash flood in Lynmouth,
OL,7,     FDevon, caused the death of 34
OL,8,     Fpeople as debris smashed into
OL,9,     Fbuildings. Then exactly 52 years
OL,10,     Flater, an eerily similar event
OL,11,     Fstruck Boscastle in Cornwall.
OL,12,G2030 The Great Storm of '87
OL,13,     FTold in forensic detail, we
OL,14,     Freveals the incredible story of an
OL,15,     Ficonic event - a 'once in 500
OL,16,     Fyears' storm that took a nation by
OL,17,     Fsurprise and changed the British
OL,18,     Flandscape forever.
